ing distinction (rows E4/E5 vs E6) that mutant M5 confirms is load-bearing.","ttft_ms":3764,"type":"result","duration_ms":836589,"uuid":"e7730b87-b1fa-44b7-97fa-b0aea7c7c3af","ttft_stream_ms":3570,"time_to_request_ms":51,"first_content_frame_ms":3570,"queued_turn_count":0}
